18:05.560 --> 18:06.840
book in the Library of Congress.

18:07.620 --> 18:09.480
That's, yeah, that's exactly it.

18:09.520 --> 18:13.240
The answer is tiny, but the retrieval process is infinitely deep.

18:13.480 --> 18:15.200
That's an excellent way to conceptualize it.

