The rule for how the universe updates is synchronous.

18:59.740 --> 19:04.180
At every tick of the clock, every single particle looks at the cell immediately to its right.

19:04.600 --> 19:05.200
Just to the right.

19:05.360 --> 19:05.880
Just to the right.

19:06.280 --> 19:09.340
