So on the next tick, the state becomes empty, particle, empty, particle.

21:21.100 --> 21:21.580
Oh.

21:22.680 --> 21:22.940
Okay.

21:23.000 --> 21:23.660
I see the failure.

21:25.060 --> 21:27.880
My prison states looked perfectly identical to my tool.

21:28.320 --> 21:30.420
