The author writes this brilliant line.

21:41.080 --> 21:45.420
A conserved quantity is sufficient for the question of whether it will remain the same,

21:45.560 --> 21:49.480
but it is insufficient for almost every other question you might want to ask about the future.

21:50.000 --> 21:50.100
Wow.

21:50.280 --> 21:55.920
Particle number is a coordinate on the map of the state space, but it is not a coordinate system for it.

