The phase is essentially the timing of the wave.

23:36.160 --> 23:39.140
It is the wave at its peak, its trough, or somewhere in between.

23:39.300 --> 23:39.440
Right.

23:39.440 --> 23:44.460
And just like ripples on a pond, if two waves meet and their peaks align, they add together and get bigger.

23:44.800 --> 23:46.000
That's constructive interference.

23:46.500 --> 23:49.640
If a peak meets a trough, they cancel each other out perfectly.

23:49.880 --> 23:51.200
That's destructive interference.

23:51.460 --> 23:52.380
So the phase is everything.

23:52.860 --> 23:56.620
The phase holds the instructions for how the possible futures interact with each other.

23:56.680 --> 23:56.800
Right.

