When we actually measure something, when we force the universe to give us an answer and we make an observation, we project that data.

24:13.260 --> 24:25.500
We take the magnitude of the amplitude, we square it to get a normal, everyday classical probability, like there's a 30% chance the electron is here, and we completely, utterly throw away the phase.

24:25.580 --> 24:27.820
We just toss the timing of the wave in the trash.

24:27.900 --> 24:28.220
Exactly.

24:28.220 --> 24:40.720
The mathematical map from the beautiful, reversible, unitary evolution of complex amplitudes down to a matrix of classical transition probabilities is a projection that intrinsically loses information.

24:41.260 --> 24:43.180
It forcibly forgets the interference terms.

24:43.820 --> 24:45.960
Nature demands that compression when you observe it.

24:47.080 --> 24:52.740
And Flyxion's manuscript points out a catastrophic mathematical failure that happens when we are forced to do this.

24:53.380 --> 24:54.580
Proposition 7.2.

24:55.100 --> 24:56.400
The failure of composition.

24:56.400 --> 25:03.660
Walk me through exactly how this breaks down, because when I read it, it felt like discovering a glitch in the matrix of reality.

