The negative phases cancel out the state 0 probability entirely and constructively reinforce the state 1 probability.

25:56.740 --> 25:59.320
They perfectly cancel the superposition out.

25:59.680 --> 26:04.140
You deterministically, with 100% certainty, restore the original state 1.

26:04.340 --> 26:04.620
Right.

26:05.320 --> 26:14.740
If I start with a 1, apply Hadamard, I'm in a quantum blur, apply Hadamard again, the blur perfectly resolves back to exactly 1.

26:14.900 --> 26:15.660
It's totally reversible.

26:16.180 --> 26:16.640
Exactly.

26:16.640 --> 26:19.380
That is the true history of the universe.

