You've lost the depth.

28:17.900 --> 28:18.820
You've lost the phase.

28:18.820 --> 28:30.140
If we connect this to the bigger picture, your shadow analogy is the perfect segue to understanding the next major concept in the manuscript, which is the Zwanzyg Mori memory kernels.

