For the Hadamard evolution we just discussed, the text mathematically proves that it has a kernel lag of exactly one step.

30:34.000 --> 30:34.500
One step.

30:34.840 --> 30:40.260
To know what the probability shadow is going to do on step three, you cannot just look at the shadow on step two.

30:40.620 --> 30:42.700
You have to look at the shadow on step one.

30:43.200 --> 30:50.540
The memory kernel represents the delayed effect of the unobserved coherences traveling through the history of the system and hitting you now.

30:50.740 --> 30:51.520
This is wild.

30:51.520 --> 30:54.820
The universe isn't just letting us forget things cleanly.

30:55.260 --> 30:58.300
We can't just throw the phase away and wash our hands of it.

30:58.840 --> 31:05.080
If we try to take a classical shortcut, the universe hands us a bill, a literal memory debt.

31:05.380 --> 31:06.200
You have to pay up.

