We have to keep track of an increasingly long history of the past to mathematically compensate for the information we threw away in the present.

31:13.840 --> 31:22.080
And this realization leads fly action to differentiate between two vital concepts in the text, the two grades of sufficiency.

31:22.440 --> 31:26.500
There is support sufficiency and there is probabilistic sufficiency.

31:26.900 --> 31:28.100
Okay, let's break those down.

