The state vector up to a global phase, the quantum state itself, the very mathematical object physicists use to describe a particle, is mathematically proven to be simply the minimal probabilistic quotient of the history structure.

33:05.580 --> 33:07.300
So it's the perfectly packed suitcase.

33:07.300 --> 33:11.900
It is the perfectly packed suitcase for a probabilistic quantum universe.

33:12.420 --> 33:16.800
So the lost phase isn't just a rounding error or a math quirk.

